    new "El dinero que conseguí y el dinero que no conseguí."

    old "And from the sound of it, you're talkin about all the money I don't got."
    new "Y por el tono de eso, estás hablando de todo el dinero que no tengo."

    old "Sarah saw Alaric, repressing his rage."
    new "Sarah vio a Alaric, reprimiendo su ira."

    old "He didn't seem like a man that took being talked down to very well, and yet he endured the man's taunts."
    new "No parecía un hombre que soportara bien que le hablaran con desprecio, y sin embargo aguantó las burlas."

    old "Who was this Damian to him?"
    new "¿Quién era este Damian para él?"

