    old "Now, like I said, I can cut you a deal and let the both of you stay here, but the debt is a problem..."
    new "Ahora, como ya dije, puedo ofrecerte un trato y dejar que los dos se queden aquí, pero la deuda es un problema..."

    old "Sarah could see Damian's eyes begin to wander over to her."
    new "Sarah pudo ver cómo los ojos de Damian empezaron a vagar hacia ella."

    old "Now..."
    new "Ahora..."

    old "Seein as you can't make the payment..."
