    new "Quizás la señorita de aquí podría adelantar algo de eso..."

    old "I don't have any money either, sir. I'm sorry."
    new "No tengo dinero tampoco, señor. Lo siento."

    old "Idiot..."
    new "Idiota..."

    old "Sarah looked at Alaric, confused."
    new "Sarah miró a Alaric, confundida."

    old "He's not askin for your money."
    new "No te está pidiendo tu dinero."

    old "He wants to fuck you."
    new "Él quiere follarte."

    old "Sarah's eyes went wide as she looked back at Damian. A man she'd only moments before confused for his kindness."
    new "Los ojos de Sarah se abrieron de par en par al volver la mirada hacia Damian, un hombre que apenas momentos antes había confundido con su bondad."

    old "I...no, sir...I think that..."
    new "I... no, señor... creo que..."

    old "What?"
    new "¿Qué?"

    old "I ain't that ugly, am I? You call me ugly in my own home?"
    new "No soy tan feo, ¿verdad? ¿Me llamas feo en mi propia casa?"

    old "Sarah shook her head, vigourously."
    new "Sarah negó con la cabeza con vigor."

    old "No, sir, of course not. I didn't mean to give offense."
    new "No, señor, por supuesto que no. No quise dar ofensa."

    old "I was just saying that, I don't think that..."
    new "Solo decía eso, no creo que..."

    old "Come on now."
    new "Vamos ya."

    old "You in The Den."
    new "En El Refugio."

    old "I don't doubt you saw plenty a ladies turnin an honest trick for a food and a bed."
    new "No dudo que hayas visto a muchas putas haciendo un trabajo honesto por comida y una cama."

    old "You sayin you better than them?"
    new "¿Dices que eres mejor que ellos?"

    old "I just, I don't think...if...we can just come to...a different understanding then..."
    new "Solo... no creo que... si... podemos llegar a... un entendimiento diferente entonces..."

    old "Damian shrugged."
    new "Damian encogió los hombros."

    old "I take any payment you got."
    new "Yo acepto cualquier pago que tengas."

    old "You got a stash of coins or jewels that I don't know about?"
    new "¿Tienes un escondite de monedas o joyas que no conozco?"

    old "Hand em over and you and ya boy can sleep here for a year."
    new "Manos arriba y tú con tu chico pueden dormir aquí un año."

    old "Sarah felt herself starting to shake."
    new "Sarah se sentía comenzar a temblar."

    old "We don't...we don't have that kind of money..."
    new "No tenemos... no tenemos ese tipo de dinero..."

    old "Exactly."
    new "Exactamente."

    old "You ain't got a dime, so I'm doin the honest and friendly thing. I'm lettin you pay the other way."
    new "No tienes ni un centavo, así que hago lo honesto y amable: te dejo que pagues de otra forma."

    old "Sarah turned to look at Alaric."
    new "Sarah se giró para mirar a Alaric."

    old "She hoped to see him standing up for her."
    new "Esperaba verlo defenderla."

    old "Instead, he had lowered his head, turned away from her."
    new "En su lugar, se inclinó la cabeza y apartó la mirada."

    old "Saying nothing."
    new "En silencio."

    old "We...we could just go somewhere else if it's any trouble..."
    new "Podríamos ir a otro lugar si es que eso le causa problemas..."

    old "Damian grinned."
    new "Damian sonrió."

    old "That dress of yours is worth a decent penny."
    new "Ese vestido tuyo vale un buen dinero."

    old "You sleep on the streets in The Den, more than a few that will slit your throat just to take it off you."
    new "Duermes en las calles de El Refugio, y más de uno te cortará la garganta solo para quitártelo."

    old "At least here you can sleep under a roof."
    new "Al menos aquí puedes dormir bajo un techo."

    old "A warm meal."
    new "Una comida caliente."

    old "Keep your dress."
    new "Mantén tu vestido."

    old "And hell, even keep that pretty throat in one piece."
    new "Y por el amor de Dios, mantén esa garganta preciosa intacta."

    old "Honestly, missy, I'm doin you and ya boy a favor. You keep refusin me, and I might just take offense and throw you both out."
    new "Honestamente, preciosa, te estoy haciendo un favor a ti y a tu chico. Si sigues negándote, podría tomarme el asunto a mal e echaros a los dos."

    old "Insultin a man in his own home? That ain't no proper way to treat a host."
    new "¿Insultar a un hombre en su propia casa? Eso no es la manera correcta de tratar a un anfitrión."

    old "No, we didn't...I didn't..."
    new "No, no lo hicimos... Yo no..."

    old "She looked over at Alaric again."
    new "Miró de nuevo a Alaric."

    old "Sarah realized he wasn't going to be any help."
    new "Sarah se dio cuenta de que no le iba a servir de nada."

    old "She couldn't believe she was really going to agree to this."
    new "No podía creer que realmente estuviera a punto de aceptar esto."

    old "I...Okay..."
    new "...Vale..."

    old "She saw a wide grind on Damian's face."
    new "Vio una mueca de sorpresa en el rostro de Damian."

    old "Seems like we got a deal, missy."
    new "Parece que hemos hecho un trato, guapa."

    old "I should be thankin ya, boy."
    new "Yo debería darte las gracias, muchacho."

    old "My night was gonna be pretty borin before you showed up with this piece."
    new "Mi noche iba a ser bastante aburrida antes de que aparecieras con esto."

    old "Damian stood up and slapped his thigs."
    new "Damian se levantó y dio una palmada en sus nalgas."

    old "Okay then."
    new "De acuerdo, entonces."

    old "You, missy."
    new "Tú, señorita."

    old "He snapped his fingers at her."
    new "Él le chasqueó los dedos con curiosidad."

    old "You come with me, you'll be spendin ya night in my room."
    new "Si vienes conmigo, pasarás la noche en mi habitación."

    old "You, boy..."
    new "Tú, muchacho..."

    old "He pointed at Alaric."
    new "Señaló a Alaric."

    old "Go drink your tea. Sleep on the couch. Play with your dick or somethin, I really don't care."
    new "Béete el té. Duérmete en el sofá. Juega con tu polla o lo que sea, no me importa nada."

    old "Sarah slowly stood up."
    new "Sarah se levantó lentamente."

    old "Part of her hoped Alaric would reach out. Stop her. Jump in front of her. Protect her."
    new "Parte de ella esperaba que Alaric se acercara. Que la detuviera. Que saltara delante de ella. Que la protegiera."

    old "Say. Say anything. Say something."
    new "Di. Di cualquier cosa. Di algo."

    old "Instead, when she looked at him, she saw him still staring at the ground."
    new "En su lugar, cuando lo miró, lo vio aún mirando al suelo."

    old "His nails, digging into the arm rest of the couch."
    new "Sus uñas clavadas en el reposabrazos del sofá."

    old "Rage."
    new "Rabia."

    old "Impotent rage."
    new "Rabia impotente."

    old "Sarah turned away and slowly walked towards Damian."
    new "Sarah se giró y caminó lentamente hacia Damian."

    old "Alaric had kept them safe on the streets...perhaps this was her way of repaying the favor..."
    new "Alaric los había mantenido a salvo en las calles... quizás esta fuera su manera de devolver el favor..."
